  "description": "A reset, a reduced-motion switch, default tokens, Sass mixins for self-hosted fonts, container queries, a breakpoint, focus rings, visually hidden text and a two-column spread, a fluid size in rem, a PostCSS plugin that lists Arial's metric twins in fontaine's fallback faces, a measure-font bin that sizes fallback faces and converts a ch to em, a skip link that clears the notch, an entrance on the first landing, a Sass importer that serves values a script shares, and checks for WCAG contrast between colour tokens and for sizes the user's font size cannot reach and font tokens that skip their fallback face",
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/culori": "^4.0.1",
    "lightningcss": "^1.33.0",
    "postcss": "^8.5.28",
    "sass": "^1.105.0"
  },
